{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：21:21 2026-11-26 HKT<br/>發佈時間：18:37 2026-11-26 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：18:37 2026-11-26 HKT</p><img alt=\"旺角有棚網冒煙被迅速救熄 疑工程時誤燃雜物引致 男工燒傷送院\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/23c591ae36aa773bc3e7be5f2ec35f81/2026-11/collage_86.jpg\"/><p>旺角登打士街近窩打老道一大廈棚架，今日（11月26日）下午5時許冒煙，消防接報趕至，動用一喉一煙帽隊，迅速將火救熄。經初步調查，相信當時一名55歲姓李男工正在外牆進行水喉工程時，其間燒着雜物所致，意外燒傷自己，火花其後亦波及棚網。</p><p>男工手及小腿燒傷，清醒被送往廣華醫院救治，案件列「火警」及「有人意外受傷」跟進。事故期間，窩打老道往九龍塘方向近登打士街部份行車線封閉，交通繁忙。</p><img alt=\"現場為旺角登打士街近窩打老道一棚架。Threads：icyboreddaily\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5d558eaa9a77dcdcbc00eaefe69c139c/2026-11/929220357_18139974868788444_3079723373155248546_n.jpg\"/><img alt=\"現場為旺角登打士街近窩打老道一棚架。Threads：icyboreddaily\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/79332a9e222fa9a6f688d7658bf6377a/2026-11/930378942_18139974835788444_5225698637848080969_n.jpg\"/><img alt=\"消防到場撲救。Threads：icyboreddaily\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5c59d3a6a42b327a4a79ad386793f6c7/2026-11/932368172_18139974799788444_5659228282774978301_n.jpg\"/><img alt=\"消防到場撲救。Threads：icyboreddaily\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7b71412e8a5ee6edf6aec788654cd442/2026-11/925705174_18139974829788444_4159507085016637053_n.jpg\"/><img alt=\"消防到場撲救。Threads：icyboreddaily\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8fac020a4ab0562c4e71078290a97dc0/2026-11/932191907_18139974781788444_7379434248174237725_n.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T13:44:11.440883+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":272,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T13:21:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T23:37:52.384827+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T13:37:27.007067+00:00","content_hash":"fa095bb4dfe60a2e54318dbd01f98ea00bb327709714944793a5827f65f0103a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}